# sent_id = sent1.1.2.3
# text = 其御子高望の王の時始めて平の姓を給て、上總介になり給しより、忽に王氏を出て人臣につらなる。
# reading_translation = From the time of his son Prince Takamochi, when he first received the surname Taira and became the governor of Kazusa, he suddenly left the imperial family and joined the ranks of subjects.
