# sent_id = sent1.4.2.1
# text = 六波羅殿の御一家の君達といひてしかば、花族も英雄も面をむかへ肩をならぶる人なし。されば入道相國のこしうと、平大納言時忠卿ののたまひけるは「此一門にあらざらむ人は皆人非人なるべし。」とぞのたまひける。かゝりしかば、いかなる人も相構へて其ゆかりにむすぼほれんとぞしける。衣文のかきやう烏帽子のため樣よりはじめて何事も六波羅樣といひてければ、一天四海の人皆是をまなぶ。
# reading_translation = When they were called the young lords of the Rokuhara household, there was no one among the flower clans or heroes who could face them or stand shoulder to shoulder with them. Therefore, the lay monk prime minister's brother-in-law, Taira no Dainagon Tokitada, said, "Anyone who is not of this clan must be a non-human." And so it was said. Since it was like that, people of every kind strove to attach themselves to that connection. Beginning with the way of folding robes and the style of wearing eboshi, in everything they said 'the Rokuhara style,' and people throughout the realm all imitated it.
# literal_translation = Rokuhara lord's honorable family's young lords as they called, flower clans also heroes also face to face shoulder to line up person there-is-not. Therefore lay monk prime minister's brother-in-law, Taira Dainagon Tokitada lord said, "This clan in not-be person all people non-human should-be." thus said. Like-that was, what person also strive and that connection to tie tried. Robe's way of folding, eboshi's way of wearing from beginning, what thing also Rokuhara style said, one heaven four seas people all this imitated.
# transliteration = Rokuharadono no goikke no kindachi to īte shikaba, kazoku mo eiyū mo omote o mukae kata o naraburu hito nashi. sareba nyūdōshōkoku no koshūto, tairanodainagontokitadakyō no notamaikeru ha" kono ichimon ni ara zara n hito ha mina ninpinin naru beshi." to zo notamaikeru. kakarishikaba, ikanaru hito mo aikamaete sono yukari ni musubōren to zo shikeru. emon no kakiyō eboshi no tameyō yori hajimete nanigoto mo rokuharayō toīte kereba, ittenshikai no hito mina kore o manabu.
