# sent_id = sent1.5.3.3
# text = 一人は櫻町の中納言重教卿の北の方にておはすべかりしが、八歳の時約束ばかりにて平治の亂以後ひきちがへられ、花山院の左大臣殿の御臺盤所にならせ給て君達あまたましましけり。
# reading_translation = One of them was the wife of the Middle Counselor Shigemasa of Sakura-machi, but at the age of eight, after only a betrothal, she was taken away after the Heiji Rebellion, and became the lady-in-waiting of the Minister of the Left of Kazan-in, and had many children.
# literal_translation = One-person as-for Sakura-machi's Middle-Counselor Shigemasa's wife as being should-have-been but, eight-years-old's time betrothal-only with Heiji's rebellion after was-taken-away, Kazan-in's Minister-of-the-Left's lady-in-waiting as became and children many existed.
