# sent_id = sent1.6.11.16
# text = もとよりわらは推參の者にて、出され參らせ候ひしを、祇王御前の申状によてこそ、召し返されても候ふに、女のかひなきこと、我身を心に任せずして、おしとゞめられまゐらせし事心うゝさぶらひしが、いつぞや又めされまゐらせていまやううたひ給ひしにも思しられてこそさぶらへ。
# reading_translation = Originally I was a person who had intruded uninvited, and when I was sent away, it was due to the petition of Gio Gozen that I was called back; but the helplessness of a woman, not having my own body at my disposal, being detained against my will—that was truly mortifying. Yet at some point I was summoned again and you had me sing an imayo, and I felt that you had remembered me.
# literal_translation = Originally I, an intruding person being, was sent away, Gio Gozen's petition by means of, was called back, but woman's helplessness, my own body to my heart not entrusting, was detained—mortifying was, but at some time again was summoned, imayo sang, and was remembered.
# transliteration = Motoyori warawa suisan no mono nite, dasare mairase sōrai shi o, giō gozen no mōshijō ni yotte koso, meshikaesare te mo sōrō ni, onna no kainaki koto, wagami o kokoro ni makase zu shite, oshitodomerare mairase shi koto kokorōu saburai shi ga, itsuzoya mata mesare mairase te imayō utai tamai shi ni mo oboshirare te koso saburae.
