# sent_id = sent1.6.11.33
# text = 夢にだに知らず、憂き世の中のさがなれば、身の憂とこそおもふべきに、ともすれば、わごぜの事のみうらめしくて往生の素懷を遂ん事かなふべしともおぼえず、今生も後生も、なまじひに仕損じたるこゝちにてありつるに、かやうにさまをかへておはしたれば、日比の咎は露塵ほども殘らず、今は往生疑ひなし。
# reading_translation = Even in dreams I did not know it, but since it is the way of this sorrowful world, I should have thought it was my own misfortune; yet, whenever I did, I felt only resentment toward you, and it did not seem possible that I could fulfill my long-cherished wish for rebirth in the Pure Land. In both this life and the next, I had the feeling of having half-failed, but now that you have come in this changed form, the faults of past days have not left even a speck of dust, and now there is no doubt about my rebirth.
# literal_translation = Even-in-dream not-know, sorrowful-world's way since-is, my-own-misfortune as-for should-have-thought, but whenever, you-of matter only resentful-being, rebirth's long-cherished-wish fulfill thing possible-be also not-seem, this-life also next-life also, half-heartedly having-failed feeling with-was, but this-kind-of form changing have-come since, past-days' faults dust-speck amount-even not-remain, now rebirth doubt is-not.
# transliteration = Yume ni dani shira zu, ukiyo no naka no saga nare ba, mi no u to koso omō beki ni, tomosureba, wagoze no koto nomi urameshiku te ōjō no sokai o togen koto kanau beshi tomo oboe zu, konjō mo goshō mo, namajīni shisonji taru kokochi nite ari tsuru ni, kayōni sama o kae te owashi tare ba, higoro no toga ha tsuyuchiri hodo mo nokora zu, ima ha ōjō utagai nashi.
