# sent_id = sent1.9.1.14
# text = 清水寺燒けたりける朝、何者の態にや在けん、「觀音火坑變成池はいかに」と札に書て、大門の前にたてたりければ、次の日、又「歴劫不思議力不及」と、返しの札をぞ打たりける。
# reading_translation = On the morning when Kiyomizu-dera burned, someone—who could it have been?—wrote on a placard, "How about the Kannon's vow to turn the fiery pit into a cool pond?" and stood it in front of the great gate. The next day, someone else posted a reply placard: "The power of countless kalpas of unfathomable vows cannot reach it."
# literal_translation = Kiyomizu-dera burned morning, whose deed was it? "Kannon fire-pit becomes-pond how-is-it?" on placard wrote, great gate's front stood, next day, again "countless-kalpas unfathomable power does-not-reach" reply placard struck.
