# sent_id = sent1.11.1.12
# text = 枯野の景色まことに面白かりければ、わかき侍ども三十騎ばかりめし具して、蓮臺野や、紫野、右近馬場に打出でて、鷹どもあまたすゑさせ、鶉、雲雀をおたて／＼、終日にかり暮し、薄暮に及んで六波羅へこそ歸られけれ。
# reading_translation = The scenery of the withered fields was truly delightful, so he took along about thirty young samurai and rode out to Rendaino, Murasakino, and Ukon-no-baba, had many hawks set loose, flushed quail and larks again and again, spent the whole day hunting, and as dusk fell he returned to Rokuhara.
