# text = 資盛朝臣、はふ／＼六波羅へおはして、祖父の相國禪門に、此由訴へ申されければ、入道大きに怒て、「縱ひ殿下なりとも、淨海があたりをば憚り給ふべきに、少者に左右なく、耻辱を與へられけるこそ遺恨の次第なれ。
# reading_translation = Lord Sukemori hurriedly went to Rokuhara and reported this matter to his grandfather, the lay priest Chancellor. The lay priest became very angry and said, "Even if it were the Regent himself, he should have shown respect to Jōkai's vicinity. To have so unceremoniously humiliated a young man is truly a cause for regret."
