# sent_id = sent1.12.4.1
# text = 新大納言猶恐れをも致されず、賀茂の上の社に、ある聖を籠て、御寶殿の御後なる杉の洞に壇を立てて、拏吉尼の法を百日行はせられけるほどに、彼の大杉に雷落ちかゝり、雷火おびただしく燃え上て、宮中已に危く見えけるを、宮人ども多く走り集て、これを打消つ。
# reading_translation = The new Dainagon, still not showing any fear, confined a holy man in the upper shrine of Kamo, set up an altar in a hollow of the great cedar behind the sacred hall, and had him perform the rite of Dakini for a hundred days. During that time, lightning struck that great cedar, and the fire blazed up so fiercely that the shrine seemed already in danger, but many shrine attendants rushed to the spot and extinguished it.
# literal_translation = New Dainagon still fear even not causing, Kamo's upper shrine at, a certain holy man confining, sacred hall's behind being great cedar's hollow at altar setting up, Dakini's rite for hundred days causing to perform while, that great cedar at lightning struck, thunder fire fiercely blazed up, shrine already dangerous seemed, shrine attendants many ran gathering, this extinguished.
# transliteration = Shindainagon nao osore o mo itasare zu, kamo no kami no yashiro ni, aru hijiri o komete, gohōden no gōshiro naru sugi no hora ni dan o tatete, dakini no hō o hyakunichi okonawaserare keru hodo ni, kano ōsugi ni kaminari ochikakari, raika obitadashiku moeagatte, kyūchū sudeni ayauku mie keru o, miyabito domo ōku hashiriatsumatte, kore o uchikeshitsu.
