# sent_id = sent1.14.2.2
# text = 御裁斷遲かりければ、さも可然公卿殿上人は、「あはれとく御裁許あるべきものを、昔より山門の訴訟は他に異なり、大藏卿爲房、太宰の權帥季仲は、さしも朝家の重臣たりしかども、山門の訴訟によて、流罪せられにき。
# reading_translation = Because the judgment was delayed, the court nobles and senior officials who were present said, "Alas, the imperial decision should be given quickly. Since ancient times, the lawsuits of the mountain gate have been different from others. Ōkura-kyō Tamefusa and Dazai no Gon no So Suenaka, although they were such important retainers of the imperial court, were exiled because of the mountain gate's lawsuit."
# literal_translation = Judgment was-late because, so even suitable court-nobles senior-officials, "Alas quickly imperial-decision ought-to-be thing, since-ancient-times mountain-gate's lawsuit as-for others from different, Ōkura-kyō Tamefusa, Dazai's Gon-no-So Suenaka, so-much imperial-court's important-retainers were-although, mountain-gate's lawsuit because-of, exile was-made-to-suffer."
# transliteration = Gosaidan osokari kere ba, samo shikarubeki kugyō tenjōbito ha," aware toku gosaikyo aru beki mono o, mukashi yori sanmon no soshō ha ta ni kotonari, ōkurakyō tamefusa, dazai no gonnosochi suenaka ha, sashimo chōka no jūshin tari shika domo, sanmon no soshō ni yotte, ruzai se rare ni ki."
