# sent_id = sent1.14.4.2
# text = 結願の導師には、仲胤法印、その比はいまだ仲胤供奉と申しが、高座に上り、かね打ならし、表白の詞にいはく、「我等なたねの二葉よりおふし立て給ふ神達、後二條の關白殿に、鏑矢一つ放ち當て給へ、大八王子權現。
# reading_translation = As the officiant for the concluding ceremony, Nakatsukasa Hōin—who at that time was still called Nakatsukasa Kubu—ascended the high seat, struck the gong, and in the words of the declaration said: "O gods who have raised us from the seedling leaves of our lineage, shoot a single whistling arrow and strike the former Chancellor Nijō, O Great Hachiman Bodhisattva."
# literal_translation = Concluding-ceremony's officiant as-for, Nakatsukasa-Hōin, that time as-for still Nakatsukasa-Kubu called, high-seat onto ascended, gong struck, declaration's words in said: "We lineage's seedling-leaves from raised gods, Later-Nijō's Chancellor Lord at, whistling-arrow one shot strike, Great-Hachiman-Bodhisattva."
