# sent_id = sent1.14.4.7
# text = やがて山王の御咎めとて、後二條の關白殿、重き御病をうけさせ給ひしかば、母上、大殿の北の政所大に歎かせ給つゝ、御樣をやつし、賤しき下臈のまねをして、日吉の社に御參籠あて、七日七夜が間祈申させ給けり。
# reading_translation = Then, saying it was the punishment of Sannō, the Kampaku of the Second Rank, Lord Fujiwara no Moronaga, fell gravely ill. His mother, the Kita no Mandokoro of the Great Palace, grieved deeply, and disguising herself, imitating a lowly servant, she confined herself in the shrine of Hiyoshi and prayed for seven days and seven nights.
# literal_translation = Immediately Sannō's punishment saying, the Later Nijō Kampaku Lord, grave illness received, when, mother, Great Palace's north Mandokoro greatly grieved, appearance disguising, lowly servant's imitation doing, Hiyoshi's shrine in confinement, seven days seven nights during prayed.
# transliteration = Yagate sannō no otogame tote gonijōnokanpakudono omoki oyamai o uke sase tamai shika ba hahaue ōtononokitanomandokoro ōini nageka se sase tamai tsutsu on'yō o yatsushi iyashiki gerō no mane o shite hiyoshi no yashiro ni gosanrō ate nanuka nanayo ga aida inorimōsase tama keri.
