# text = あらはれての御祈には、百番の芝田樂、百番の一物、競馬、流鏑馬、相撲各百番、百座の仁王講、百座の藥師講、一ちやく手半の藥師百體、等身の藥師一體並に釋迦、阿彌陀の像、各造立供養せられけり。
# reading_translation = For the prayers that were revealed, there were one hundred performances of shiba-sarugaku, one hundred performances of hitotsumono, horse racing, yabusame, sumo wrestling, one hundred each; one hundred sessions of the Niō lecture, one hundred sessions of the Yakushi lecture, one hundred statues of Yakushi of one and a half shaku, one life-size statue of Yakushi, and statues of Shaka and Amida, all of which were made and dedicated.
# literal_translation = Revealed prayers for, hundred performances of shiba-sarugaku, hundred performances of hitotsumono, horse racing, yabusame, sumo each hundred, hundred sessions of Niō lecture, hundred sessions of Yakushi lecture, one shaku and a half of Yakushi hundred statues, life-size Yakushi one statue, and Shaka, Amida statues, each made and dedicated were.
