# sent_id = sent2.1.4.4
# text = 山門に宿老碩徳多といへども、澄憲法印、其時はいまだ僧都にて坐けるが、餘に名殘を惜み奉り、粟津まで送り參せ、さてもあるべきならねば、それより暇申てかへられけるに、僧正志の切なる事を感じて、年來御心中に祕せられたりし、一心三觀の血脈相承をさづけらる。
# reading_translation = Though there were many venerable elders at the monastery, the Dharma Seal Chōken, who was then still a Sōzu, so deeply regretted the departure that he accompanied him as far as Awazu; and when he could not remain longer, he took his leave and returned. The Archbishop, moved by his earnest devotion, bestowed upon him the secret transmission of the One Mind, Three Contemplations, which he had kept hidden in his heart for years.
# literal_translation = At the monastery, though there were many venerable elders, the Dharma Seal Chōken, at that time was still a Sōzu, but he so regretted the departure, accompanied him as far as Awazu, and since it was not possible to remain, he took his leave and returned; the Archbishop, moved by his earnest devotion, bestowed upon him the secret transmission of the One Mind, Three Contemplations, which he had kept hidden in his heart for years.
# transliteration = Sanmon ni shukurō sekitoku ōku to ie domo, chōkenhōin, sonotoki ha imada sōzu nite mashi keru ga, amarini nagori o oshimi tatematsuri, awazu made okuri mairase, satemo aru beki nara ne ba, sore yori itoma mōshi te kaera re keru ni, sōjō kokorozashi no setsunaru koto o kanji te, nenrai goshinchū ni hise rare tari shi, isshinsangan no kechimyakusōjō o sazuke raru.
# generator = deepseek-v4-pro
