# text = 素絹の衣の、短らかなるに、白き大口ふみくゝみ、聖柄の刀押くつろげてさす儘に、以の外に怒れる氣色にて、大納言を暫睨まへ、「抑御邊は平治にも已に誅せらるべかりしを、内府が身にかへて申宥、頸を繼たてましは如何に。
# reading_translation = Wearing a short white silk robe, with a white hakama tucked up, and a sword with a hollyhock-crest scabbard thrust loosely at his side, he glared at the Major Counselor for a while with an extremely angry look and said, "Well now, you were already supposed to have been executed even in the Heiji Disturbance, but the Inner Minister exchanged his own life to plead for you and saved your neck—how is it that you now plot to destroy this clan?"
# literal_translation = White silk robe's, short being, white hakama tucking up, hollyhock-crest sword pushing loosen and thrust as, extremely angry look with, Major Counselor at for a while glaring, "Well, you as for in Heiji also already be executed should have been, Inner Minister his body exchanging pleaded and pardoned, neck connected gave—how is it?"
