# sent_id = sent2.6.4.1
# text = 入道ふし目に成て、あはれ例の内府が、世をへうする樣に振舞、大に諫ばやとこそ思はれけめども、さすが子ながらも、内には五戒を保て慈悲を先とし、外には五常を亂らず、禮儀を正しうし給ふ人なれば、あの姿に腹卷を著て向はむ事、面はゆう辱しうや思はれけん、障子を少し引立て、素絹の衣を腹卷の上に、周章著に著給たりけるが、胸板の金物の少しはづれて見えけるを藏さうと、頻に衣の胸を引ちがへ引ちがへぞし給ひける。
# reading_translation = The lay monk, with narrowed eyes, thought that the Inner Minister was behaving as if he would destroy the world, and he wanted to remonstrate strongly. But even though he was his son, the Inner Minister was a man who inwardly kept the five precepts and put compassion first, and outwardly did not violate the five constant virtues and performed propriety correctly. So the lay monk felt ashamed and embarrassed to face him wearing a belly armor in that appearance. He slightly opened the sliding door, and hurriedly put on a plain silk robe over the belly armor. The metal fittings of the breastplate were slightly visible, and he repeatedly pulled the front of the robe to hide them.
# literal_translation = The lay monk, with narrowed eyes becoming, alas, the usual Inner Minister, as if destroying the world behaving, greatly remonstrate-want-to, he thought, but, even so, though being his son, inwardly the five precepts keeping, compassion first making, outwardly the five constants not violating, propriety correctly doing-giving person because, that appearance in belly armor wearing facing thing, ashamed embarrassed he thought, the sliding door a little pulling open, plain silk robe belly armor over, hurriedly putting on gave, but, breastplate's metal fittings a little coming off visible were, to hide, repeatedly the robe's front pulling over pulling over did.
# transliteration = Nyūdō fushimeni natte, aware reino naifu ga, yo o hyōsuru yōni furumai, daini isamebaya to koso omoware kemedomo, sasuga konagaramo, uchini ha gokai o tamote jihi o sakitoshi, sotoni ha gojō o midarazu, reigi o tadashiushi tamau hito nareba, ano sugatani haramaki o kite mukawamu koto, omohayū hazukashiu ya omoware ken, shōji o sukoshi hikitate, soken no koromo o haramaki no ueni, shūshō kini kitamaitari keru ga, munaita no kanamono no sukoshi hazurete miekeru o kakusasō to, shikirini koromo no mune o hikichigae hikichigae zo shitamaikeru.
# generator = deepseek-v4-pro
