# reading_translation = The distance between Bitchū's Seo and Bizen's Aruki no Bessho was barely fifty chō, so perhaps even Tanba no Shōshō felt a pang of longing for that direction; one time he summoned Kaneyasu and asked, "How far is it from here to Bizen's Aruki no Bessho, where the Dainagon is said to be crossing over?"
