# sent_id = sent2.12.1.1
# text = さる程に、法皇は三井寺の公顯僧正を御師範として、眞言の祕法を傳受せさせましけるが、大日經、金剛頂經、蘇悉地經、此三部の祕法を受させ給ひて、九月四日、三井寺にて御灌頂有るべしとぞ聞えける。
# reading_translation = Meanwhile, the Cloistered Emperor, having made the monk Kōken of Mii-dera his teacher, had him transmit the secret rites of Shingon; he received the secret rites of the three scriptures—the Dainichi-kyō, the Kongōchō-kyō, and the Soshitsuji-kyō—and it was heard that on the fourth day of the ninth month, the abhisheka (initiation) was to be held at Mii-dera.
# literal_translation = In the meantime, the Cloistered Emperor, making the monk Kōken of Mii-dera his teacher, caused him to transmit the secret rites of Shingon; he received the secret rites of these three scriptures—the Dainichi-kyō, the Kongōchō-kyō, and the Soshitsuji-kyō—and it was heard that on the fourth day of the ninth month, the abhisheka was to be held at Mii-dera.
