# sent_id = sent2.14.1.3
# text = 佛滅度の後、天竺に留らせ給ふ事、五百餘歳、佛法東漸の理にて、百濟國に移らせ給ひて、一千歳の後、百濟の帝齊明王、我朝の帝欽明天皇の御宇に及で、彼國より此國へ移らせ給ひて、攝津國難波の浦にして、星霜を送らせ給ひけり。
# reading_translation = After the Buddha's passing, it remained in India for more than five hundred years. Then, in accordance with the principle of the eastward spread of Buddhism, it moved to the kingdom of Baekje. After a thousand years, during the reign of Emperor Seimei of Baekje and the reign of Emperor Kinmei of our court, it moved from that country to this country, and at the bay of Naniwa in Settsu Province, it passed the years.
# literal_translation = Buddha's passing's after, India in remained gave thing, five-hundred more years, Buddhism eastward-spread's principle by, Baekje-country to moved gave, one-thousand years' after, Baekje's emperor Seimei-king, our court's emperor Kinmei-emperor's reign to reached, that-country from this-country to moved gave, Settsu-province Naniwa's bay at, years passed gave.
# transliteration = Hotoke metsudo no nochi, tenjiku ni todomarase tamau koto, gohyakuyosai, buppō tōzen no ri nite, kudarakoku ni utsurase tamaite, issensai no nochi, kudara no mikado seimeiō, wagachō no mikado kinmeitennō no gyō ni oyonde, kanokuni yori konokuni he utsurase tamaite, settsunokuni naniwa no ura nite, seisō o okurase tamai keri.
