# sent_id = sent2.14.1.5
# text = 同三年三月上旬に信濃國の住人、麻績の本太善光と云者都へ上りたりけるに、彼如來に逢奉りたりけるに、軈ていざなひ參せて、晝は善光、如來を負奉り、夜は善光、如來に負はれ奉て、信濃國へ下り、水内郡に安置し奉しよりこのかた、星霜既に五百八十餘歳、炎上の例は是始とぞ承る。
# reading_translation = In the first ten days of the third month of the same third year, a resident of Shinano Province, a man called Honda Zenkō of Omi, went up to the capital, and when he met that Buddha, he immediately invited him, and by day Zenkō carried the Buddha on his back, and by night the Buddha carried Zenkō on his back, and they went down to Shinano Province, and from the time he enshrined him in Minochi District, the years and months have already passed five hundred and eighty-some years, and this is said to be the first instance of destruction by fire.
# literal_translation = Same third year third month first ten days in, Shinano Province's resident, Omi's Honda Zenkō called person capital to went up, that Buddha met, immediately invited, day is Zenkō, Buddha carried on back, night is Zenkō, Buddha by was carried on back, Shinano Province to went down, Minochi District in enshrined from since, years and months already five hundred eighty-some years, destruction by fire's example is this first as hear.
# transliteration = Dō sannen sangatsu jōjun ni shinanonokuni no jūnin, omi no hondazenkō to iu mono miyako he nobori tari keru ni, kano nyorai ni ai tatematsuri tari keru ni, yagate izanai mairase te, hiru ha zenkō, nyorai o oi tatematsuri, yoru ha zenkō, nyorai ni owa re tatematsuri te, shinanonokuni he kudari, minochigun ni anchi shi tatematsuri shi yori konokata, seisō sudeni gohyakuhachijūyosai, enjō no rei ha kore hajime to zo uketamawaru
