# sent_id = sent2.15.1.1
# text = さる程に鬼界が島の流人共、露の命草葉の末に懸て、惜むべきとには有ね共、丹波少將の舅平宰相教盛の領、肥前國鹿瀬の庄より、衣食を常に送られければ、其にてぞ俊寛僧都も康頼も命を生て過しける。
# reading_translation = Meanwhile, the exiles on Kikaigashima, whose lives hung by a thread like dew on the tips of grass blades, though they had nothing to cling to, were constantly sent food and clothing from the estate of Kase no shō in Hizen Province, the domain of the Taira counselor Norimori, father-in-law of the Lesser Captain of Tanba; and so both Shunkan and Yasuyori managed to stay alive.
# literal_translation = In the meantime, Kikaigashima's exiles, dew-like life on grass-blade tips hanging, though there was nothing to be regretted, from Tanba Lesser Captain's father-in-law Taira Counselor Norimori's domain, Hizen Province Kase no shō, food and clothing were constantly sent, and so Shunkan and Yasuyori both kept their lives and passed the days.
# transliteration = Saruhodoni kikaigashima no runin domo, tsuyu no inochi kusaba no sue ni kakete, oshimubeki to ni ha arane domo, tanbanoshōshō no shūto heisaishō norimori no ryō, hizennokuni kanose no shō yori, ishoku o tsuneni okurarekere ba, sore nite zo shunkansōzu mo yasuyori mo inochi o ikite sugoshikeru.
