# sent_id = sent2.15.2.7
# text = 此嶺は本宮、彼は新宮、是はそんぢやう其王子、彼王子など、王子々々の名を申て、康頼入道先達にて、丹波少將相具しつゝ、日ごとに熊野詣の眞似をして、歸洛の事をぞ祈ける。
# reading_translation = They named the peaks one by one: this peak is the main shrine, that one is the new shrine, this is the prince of such-and-such, that is the prince of so-and-so, and with Yasuyori the lay monk as their guide, taking along the Lesser Captain of Tango, day after day they imitated a pilgrimage to Kumano and prayed for their return to the capital.
# literal_translation = This peak is the main shrine, that is the new shrine, this is such-and-such its prince, that prince and so on, naming the names of prince after prince, Yasuyori the lay monk being the guide, taking along the Lesser Captain of Tango, day after day imitating a Kumano pilgrimage, for the return to the capital they prayed.
