# reading_translation = As the days accumulated, since there were no pure robes to change into, he wrapped himself in hempen garments, and when he drew water from the marsh's edge, he imagined it to be the clear stream of the Iwata River; when he climbed to a high place, he envisioned it as the Gate of Aspiration.
