# sent_id = sent2.15.2.12
# text = 維當れる歳次、治承元年丁酉、月のならび十月二月、日の數三百五十餘箇日、吉日良辰を擇で、掛卷も忝なく、日本第一大靈驗、熊野三所權現、飛瀧大薩たの教令、宇豆の廣前にして、信心の大施主、羽林藤原成經、並に沙彌性照、一心清淨の誠を致し三業相應の志を抽て、謹で以て敬白す。
# reading_translation = In the year corresponding to the first year of Jishō, the cyclical year of the Fire Rooster, in the intercalary second month, on a day counted among the three hundred and fifty-odd days, choosing an auspicious day and hour, with deepest reverence, before the great shrine of the foremost wonder-working deity of Japan, the Three Shrines of Kumano, in accordance with the divine command of the Great Bodhisattva of the Flying Waterfall, the great patron of faith, the Captain of the Left Division of the Palace Guards, Fujiwara no Naritsune, together with the novice Shōshō, with single-hearted purity of sincerity and with devotion of body, speech, and mind in harmony, reverently make this declaration.
# literal_translation = Corresponding year, Jishō first year Fire-Rooster, month's intercalary second month, day's number three hundred fifty-odd days, auspicious day good hour choosing, hanging scroll also reverently, Japan's first great wonder-working, Kumano Three Shrines Manifestation, Flying Waterfall Great Bodhisattva's command, Uzu's broad front at, faith's great patron, Palace Guards Fujiwara Naritsune, together with novice Shōshō, one mind purity's sincerity exerting, three deeds mutual response's devotion drawing out, reverently with declare.
# transliteration = Koreatareru saiji, jishō gannen hinototori, tsuki no narabi jūgatsu nigatsu, hi no kazu sanbyakugojūyokabi, kichijitsu ryōshin o erabite, kakemaki mo katajikenaku, nihon daīchi daireigen, kumano sansho gongen, hirō daisatta no kyōryō, uzu no hiromae ni shite, shinjin no daiseshu, urin fujiwara naritsune, narabini shami shōshō, isshin shōjō no makoto o itashi sangō sōō no kokorozashi o nukite, tsutsushimite motte kyōbyaku su.
