# sent_id = sent3.1.1.3
# text = 太政入道も、多田藏人行綱が告知せて後は、君をも御後めたき事に思ひ奉て、上には事なき樣なれ共、下には用心して、苦笑てのみぞ在ける。
# reading_translation = After Tada no Kurando Yukitsuna informed him, the Lay Monk Prime Minister also came to regard even the sovereign with suspicion, and though he pretended outwardly that nothing was wrong, inwardly he was on his guard, and could only smile bitterly.
