# sent_id = sent3.2.2.1
# text = さる程に少將や判官入道も出來たり、少將の取てよむにも、康頼入道が讀けるにも、二人と計かかれて、三人とはかゝれざりけり。夢にこそかゝる事は有れ、夢かと思ひなさんとすれば現也、現かと思へば又夢の如し。其上二人の人々の許へは、都より言づけ文共、幾らも有けれ共、俊寛僧都の許へは、事問文一つもなし。さればわがゆかりの物どもは都のうちにあとをとゞめず成りにけりとおもひやるにもしのびがたし。
# reading_translation = In the meantime, the minor captain and the lay priest magistrate also came out. When the minor captain took it and read it, and when the lay priest Yasuyori read it, only two names were written, and the three were not written. Such a thing happens only in a dream; when I try to think it is a dream, it is reality; when I think it is reality, it is again like a dream. Moreover, to the two men's places, there were many letters and messages from the capital, but to the monk Shunkan's place, there was not even a single letter of inquiry. Therefore, when he reflected that the things related to him had vanished without a trace from the capital, it was hard to endure.
# literal_translation = In-the-meantime minor-captain and lay-priest-magistrate also came-out. Minor-captain's taking-and-reading also, Yasuyori-lay-priest's reading also, two-people only were-written, three-people as-for were-not-written. In-dream indeed such thing exists, dream perhaps think-try-to-make when, reality is, reality perhaps think when, again dream like. Moreover two people's places to, from-capital message-letters many existed, but Shunkan-monk's place to, inquiry-letter one even not. Therefore my-related things as-for capital's inside in trace without became, when-reflected also hard-to-endure.
# transliteration = Saru hodo ni shōshō ya hōgannyūdō mo shuttai tari, shōshō no totte yomu ni mo, yasuyorinyūdō ga yomikeru ni mo, futari to bakari kakarete, sannin to ha kakare zari keri. yume ni koso kakaru koto ha are, yume ka to omoi nasan to sureba utsutsu nari, utsutsu ka to omoe ba mata yume no gotoshi. sonōe futari no hitobito no moto he ha, miyako yori kotozukebumi domo, ikura mo arikere domo, shunkansōzu no moto he ha, kototoibumi hitotsu mo nashi. sareba waga yukari no monodomo ha miyako no uchi ni ato o todomezu nari ni keri to omoiyaru ni mo shinobi gatashi.
