# literal_translation = Ninna-ji Cloistered-Prince, Peacock-Sutra's rite, Tendai-Abbot Kakukai-Hosshinnō, Seven-Buddhas-of-Healing's rite, temple's head-priest Enkei-Hosshinnō, Vajra-Youth's rite, besides, Five-Great-Void-Treasures, Six-Kannon, One-Syllable-Golden-Wheel, Five-Altars' rite, Six-Syllable-Wheel, Eight-Syllable-Manjushri, Fugen-Life-Extension to reaching, without-omission performed.
