# sent_id = sent3.4.2.4
# text = をかしかりしは入道相國のあきれ樣、目出たかりしは小松大臣の振舞、本意なかりしは前右大將宗盛卿の、最愛の北方に後れ奉て、大納言大將兩職を辭して籠居せられし事、兄弟共に出仕あらば、如何に目出たからん。次に七人の陰陽師を召されて、千度の御祓仕るに、其中に、掃部頭時晴と云ふ老者有り。
# reading_translation = What was amusing was the astonishment of the Lay Monk Chancellor; what was splendid was the conduct of the Komatsu Minister; what was disappointing was that the former Major Captain of the Right, Lord Munemori, having lost his beloved wife, resigned both the offices of Major Counselor and Major Captain and secluded himself; if the brothers had both attended court, how splendid it would have been. Next, seven yin-yang masters were summoned, and when they performed the thousand-fold purification, among them was an old man called Kamon no Kami Tokiharu.
# literal_translation = Amusing-was as-for Lay-Monk-Chancellor's astonishment, splendid-was as-for Komatsu-Minister's conduct, disappointing-was as-for former-Major-Captain-of-the-Right-Lord-Munemori's, beloved-wife-from being-left-behind-humbly, Major-Counselor-Major-Captain-two-offices-ACC resigning-and-secluding-was matter, brothers-together court-attendance if-there-is, how splendid-would-be. Next seven-people-of yin-yang-masters-ACC being-summoned, thousand-times-of purification-humbly-do when, among-them, Kamon-no-Kami-Tokiharu called old-man there-was.
# transliteration = Okashikari shi ha nyūdōshōkoku no akire sama, medetakari shi ha komatsudaijin no furumai, hoinakari shi ha sakinōdaishōmunemorikyō no, saiai no kitanokata ni okure tatematsutte, dainagondaishō ryōshoku o jishite rōkyoserare shi koto, kyōdai tomoni shusshi ara ba, ikani medetakara n. tsugini shichinin no onmyōji o mesa rete, sendo no oharai tsukamatsuru ni, sononaka ni, kamonnokamitokiharu to iu rōsha ari.
