# sent_id = sent3.5.2.1
# text = 抑平家安藝の嚴島を信じ始られける事は如何にと云に、鳥羽院の御宇に清盛公未安藝守たりし時、安藝國を以て、高野の大塔を修理せよとて、渡邊遠藤六郎頼方を雜掌に附られ、六年に修理畢ぬ。
# reading_translation = Now, as for how the Heike came to believe in Aki's Itsukushima: during the reign of Emperor Toba, when Lord Kiyomori was still the governor of Aki, he was ordered to repair the great pagoda of Koya using the province of Aki, and Watanabe Endō Rokurō Yorikata was attached as the administrator. The repair was completed in six years.
# literal_translation = Now, Heike Aki's Itsukushima to believe began matter is how as for, Toba-in's reign in Kiyomori-lord still Aki-governor was time, Aki-province with, Koya's great-pagoda repair do saying, Watanabe Endo Rokuro Yorikata as administrator attached, six years in repair finished.
# transliteration = Somosomo heike aki no itsukushima o shinji hajimerare keru koto ha ikani to iuni, tobain no gyō ni kiyomorikō imada akinokami tarishi toki, akinokuni o motte, kōya no daitō o shuri seyo tote, watanabe endō rokurō yorikata o zasshō ni tsukerare, rokunen ni shuri owanu.
