# sent_id = sent3.6.1.2
# text = 主上此御腹に、皇子御誕生あらまほしう思召、其比、有驗の僧と聞えし三井寺の頼豪阿闍梨を召て、「汝此后の腹に、皇子御誕生祈り申せ、御願成就せば、勸賞はこふによるべし。
# reading_translation = The Emperor, desiring that a prince be born to this consort, summoned the Ajari Raigō of Miidera, who was renowned as a wonder-working monk, and said, "Pray that a prince be born to this consort; if your prayer is fulfilled, you shall have whatever reward you ask."
# literal_translation = Emperor this consort's womb, prince birth desiring, at that time, wonder-working monk as heard-of Miidera's Raigō Ajari summoning, "You this consort's womb, prince birth pray, prayer fulfilled if, reward is what you ask according to shall be."
