# sent_id = sent3.8.2.9
# text = 』など、慰置しを、愚に若やと頼つゝ、存へんとはせしかども、此島には人の食物絶て無き所なれば、身に力の有し程は、山に上て硫黄と云ふ物をとり、九國より通ふ商人にあひ、物に換などせしかども、日に副て弱行ば、今は其態もせず。
# reading_translation = Saying such things, I consoled myself, foolishly hoping that I might still be young, and tried to endure; but on this island there is no food for people at all, so while I still had strength in my body, I climbed the mountain to gather a thing called sulfur, met merchants who came from the nine provinces, and exchanged it for goods; but as I grew weaker day by day, now I no longer do even that.
# literal_translation = Such things, saying, consoled, foolishly young perhaps, relying, endure, tried to do, but, this island, people's food, completely, there is not, place, because, body, strength, had, while, mountain, climbed, sulfur, called, thing, gathered, nine provinces, from, came, merchants, met, goods, exchanged, did, but, day by day, weakened, now, that, even, do not.
# transliteration = 』 nado nagusameoki shi o oroka ni wakaya to tanomi tsutsu korahen to ha se shika domo konoshima ni ha hito no shokumotsu taete naki tokoro nare ba mi ni chikara no arishi hodo ha yama ni noborite iō to iu mono o tori kuni yori kayō akindo ni ai mono ni kae nado se shika domo hi ni sohite yowariyuki ba ima ha sono waza mo se zu.
