# text = 北方は少き人を隱しかねまゐらせ給ひて、鞍馬の奧に忍ばせ給て候しに、此童計こそ時々參て宮仕つかまつり候しが、何も御歎の愚なる事は候はざりしかども、稚き人は、餘に戀參させ給て、參り候度毎に、『有王よ、鬼界が島とかやへ我具して參れ。
# reading_translation = The lady of the north, unable to hide you, a small child, had you secretly stay in the depths of Kurama. Only this boy, Ario, came from time to time to serve you. Though there was nothing foolish in your lamentations, being a child, you longed for me excessively, and every time he came, you said, 'Ario, take me to Kikaigashima or wherever it is.'
# literal_translation = The north lady, small person unable to hide, to Kurama's depths made you hide, only this boy Ario from time to time came and served, though nothing of your lamentations' foolishness existed, being a child, excessively longed, every time he came, 'Ario, Kikaigashima or somewhere to me take and come.'
