# sent_id = sent3.9.1.21
# text = 今年は十二に成とこそ思に、是程はかなくては、人にも見え、宮仕をもして、身をも扶くべきか。」とて泣れけるにこそ、人の親の心は闇にあらね共、子を思ふ道に迷ふ程も知れけれ。「此島へ流されて後は、暦も無れば月日の換り行をも知らず、唯自ら花の散り、葉の落るを見て、春秋を辨へ、蝉の聲麥秋を送れば夏と思ひ、雪の積を冬と知る。
# reading_translation = This year he would turn twelve, she thought, but if he was to be so short-lived, how could he show himself to people, serve at court, and support himself?" So she wept, and indeed, a parent's heart is not darkness, yet it is lost in the path of thinking of one's child. "After being exiled to this island, there is no calendar, so I do not know the changing of months and days; only by seeing the flowers scatter and the leaves fall do I discern spring and autumn; when the cicadas' voices send off the wheat harvest, I know it is summer; by the snow piling up, I know it is winter.
# literal_translation = This year twelve become that indeed think, this extent fleeting being, to people also show, court service also doing, body also support should?" saying wept indeed, parent's heart is darkness not though, child think path in lost extent also knew. "This island to exiled after, calendar also not exist so months days changing going also not know, only self flowers scatter, leaves fall seeing, spring autumn discern, cicadas' voices wheat harvest send off when summer think, snow piling winter know.
# transliteration = Kotoshi ha jūni ni naru to koso omō ni, korehodo hakanaku te ha, hito ni mo mie, miyazukae o mo shite, mi o mo tasuku beki ka." to te nakare keru ni koso, hito no oya no kokoro ha yami ni ara ne domo, ko o omō michi ni mayō hodo mo shire kere." konoshima he nagasare te nochi ha, koyomi mo nakere ba tsukihi no kawariyuku o mo shira zu, tada onozukara hana no chiri, ha no otsuru o mi te shunjū o wakimae, semi no koe bakushū o okure ba natsu to omoi, yuki no tsumori o fuyu to shiru.
