# text = 又下向の時、岩田河を渡られけるに、嫡子權亮少將維盛已下の公達、淨衣の下に薄色の衣を著て、夏の事なれば、何となう河の水に戯れ給ふ程に、淨衣のぬれて衣に移たるが、偏に色の如くに見ければ、筑後守貞能是を見咎て、「何と候やらん、あの御淨衣の世に忌はしきやうに見させ座し候。
# reading_translation = Again, on the way down, when they were crossing the Iwata River, the young lords, with the heir Koremori, the Gon no Suke Shōshō, at their head, wore pale-colored robes under their white robes; and as it was summer, while they were somehow playing in the river water, the white robes got wet and the color showed through, looking exactly like the color [of the robes beneath]; Chikugo no kami Sadayoshi saw this and found it suspicious, saying, "What is this? That white robe of yours appears to be something the world would consider inauspicious."
# literal_translation = Again, going-down's time, Iwata-River when-crossed, heir Gon-no-Suke-Shōshō-Koremori-and-below's young-lords, white-robes' under pale-color's robes wore, summer's thing because-is, somehow river's water in played while, white-robes' getting-wet and robes-to transferred thing, entirely color's like looked because, Chikugo-no-kami-Sadayoshi this saw-and-found-suspicious, "What is-it, that honorable-white-robe world-to inauspicious like appears."
