# reading_translation = When he said this, the Minister replied, "My wish has already been fulfilled. The white robe must not be changed at all." And so, he specially sent an offering of gratitude from the Iwata River to Kumano. People thought it strange, but they did not understand his intention. Then, before long, this young lord actually wore the color of sincerity—how mysterious it was!
