# reading_translation = Because this minister's aspiration for extinguishing sins and producing good was deep, lamenting the ups and downs of the future, at the foot of the Eastern Hills, in imitation of the forty-eight great vows, he built a hall of forty-eight bays, and in each bay hung one lantern, forty-eight lanterns in forty-eight bays, so that they shone before the eyes of the nine grades of lotus pedestals, and their brilliance was like a polished mirror of a phoenix, as if facing the pure land.
