# sent_id = sent3.16.4.10
# text = 彼唐太子賓客白樂天、潯陽の江の邊にやすらひ給けん其古を思やり、鳴海潟汐路遙に遠見して、常は朗月を望み、浦風に嘯き、琵琶を彈じ、和歌を詠じて、等閑がてらに月日を送らせ給けり。
# reading_translation = Recalling the ancient times when that Tang dynasty Crown Prince's guest Bai Letian lingered by the banks of the Xunyang River, he gazed far off at the distant tide road of Narumi, constantly admired the bright moon, whistled into the sea breeze, played the biwa, composed waka poems, and idly passed the days and months.
# literal_translation = That Tang Crown-Prince's-guest Bai-Letian, Xunyang River's bank at lingered probably that ancient-times thinking-of, Narumi-tide-road far-off gazing, constantly bright-moon admired, sea-breeze at whistled, biwa played, waka composed, idly while days-months passed.
