# sent_id = sent3.18.2.5
# text = 此尼前と申は、法皇の御乳の人、紀伊二位の事也。七條を西へ、朱雀を南へ御幸成る。恠しの賤の男賤の女に至るまで「あはれ法皇の流されさせましますぞや。」とて、涙を流し袖を絞らぬは無けり。「去七日の夜の大地震も、かゝるべかりける前表にて、十六洛叉の底迄も答へ、堅牢地神の驚きさわぎ給ひけんも理哉。
# reading_translation = This nun, known as the former nurse, was the wet nurse of the cloistered emperor, Kii no Nii. The imperial procession went west along Shichijo and south along Suzaku. Even lowly men and women wept, saying, "Alas, the cloistered emperor is being sent into exile!" and there was none who did not wring their sleeves with tears. "The great earthquake of the night of the seventh day was surely an omen of this, and even the depths of the sixteen lakhs responded, and the firm earth deity was startled and alarmed—how reasonable!"
# literal_translation = This nun, former nurse as-for, cloistered emperor's wet nurse, Kii no Nii's matter is. Shichijo to west, Suzaku to south, imperial procession becomes. Strange lowly man lowly woman to reaching, "Alas, cloistered emperor's being-exiled is!" saying, tears flowing, sleeves wringing not is none. "Past seventh day's night's great earthquake also, such should-have-been omen being, sixteen lakhs' bottom to even responding, firm earth deity's being-startled being-alarmed would-have-been also reason!"
# transliteration = Kono ama zen to mōsu ha, hōō no ochichi no hito, kīnonī no koto nari. shichijō o nishi he, suzaku o minami he gokō naru. ayashi no shizu no otoko shizu no onna ni itaru made" aware hōō no nagasare sase mashimasu zo ya." tote, namida o nagashi sode o shibora nu ha nakeri." saru nanuka no yoru no daijishin mo, kakaru bekari keru zenpyō nite, jūroku rakusha no soko made mo kotae, kenrōjishin no odoroki sawagi tamai ken mo kotowari kana."
