# sent_id = sent3.18.4.1
# text = 又靜憲法印、入道相國の西八條の邸に行て、「夕法皇の鳥羽殿へ御幸成て候なるに、御前に人一人も候はぬ由承るが餘に淺ましう覺え候。何か苦う候べき、靜憲ばかりは御ゆるされ候へかし。參り給はん。」と申されければ、「とう／＼、御房は事あやまつまじき人なれば。」とて許されけり。法印鳥羽殿へ參て、門前にて車よりおり、門の内へさし入給へば、折しも法皇、御經を打上々々遊されける御聲も、殊にすごう聞えさせ給ける。
# reading_translation = Again, the Dharma Seal Jōken went to the Lay Monk Chancellor's residence in Nishihachijō and said, "I hear that last evening His Cloistered Eminence went to the Toba Palace, and that there is not a single person before him. This seems too pitiful. What harm could there be? Please grant permission for at least Jōken to go. I will go and attend him." When he said this, the Chancellor replied, "Well, well, you are a monk who would not make a mistake in such matters," and permitted him. The Dharma Seal went to the Toba Palace, got down from his carriage before the gate, and entered within. Just then, the Cloistered Emperor was chanting sutras aloud, and his voice sounded especially awe-inspiring.
# literal_translation = Again Jōken-Dharma-Seal, Lay-Monk-Chancellor's Nishihachijō's residence to went, "Yesterday-evening Cloistered-Emperor Toba-Palace to went is-heard but, before-him person one even is-not that I-hear, too pitiful seems. What harm could-be, Jōken only please-permit. I-will-go-attend." said when, "Well, well, you-monk are a person who would not make a mistake in such matters," saying, permitted. Dharma-Seal Toba-Palace to went, gate-front at carriage from got-down, gate's inside into entered when, just then Cloistered-Emperor, sutra chanting aloud was, his voice also especially awe-inspiring sounded.
# transliteration = Mata jōkenhōin, nyūdōshōkoku no nishihachijō no yashiki ni ikite," yūbe hōō no tobadono he gokō natte sōnaru ni, gozen ni hito hitori mo sōwanu yoshi uketamawaru ga amarini asamashū oboe sō. nanika kurushū sōbeki, jōken bakari ha goyurusare sōe kashi. mairi tamawan." to mōsarekereba," tōtō, gobō ha koto ayamatsumajiki hito nareba." tote yurusarekeri. hōin tobadono he maitte, monzen nite kuruma yori ori, mon no uchi he sashīretamaeba, orishimo hōō, gokyō o uchiageage asobasarekeru gosei mo kotoni sugō kikoesasetamaikeru.
