# text = 庭には雪のみ降積れ共、跡蹈つくる人も無く、池にはつらゝ閉重て、むれ居し鳥も見えざりけり。
# reading_translation = In the garden, only snow had piled up, and there was no one to tread a path; in the pond, ice had formed in layers, and the birds that had gathered there were no longer to be seen.
