# reading_translation = In foreign lands, King Cheng of Zhou was three years old, Emperor Mu of Jin was two; in our court, Emperor Konoe was three, Emperor Rokujo was two. All of them were wrapped in swaddling clothes and did not wear belts properly, yet some were carried by regents to ascend the throne, and some were held by empress dowagers to face the court.
