# reading_translation = Today being the first day of the fourth month, the day of the changing of robes, they all turned their thoughts toward the capital and were amusing themselves, when a wisteria of deep color was blooming over a pine tree on the bank. The Retired Emperor saw it and summoned the Major Counselor Takasue, saying, "Send someone to break off that flower."
