# sent_id = sent4.3.2.4
# text = 御手跡美しう遊し、御才學勝てましましければ、位にも即せ給ふべきに、故建春門院の御猜にて、押籠められさせ給つゝ、花の下の春の遊には、紫毫を揮て手から御作を書き、月の前の秋の宴には、玉笛を吹て自ら雅音を操給ふ、かくして明し暮し給ふ程に、治承四年には、御歳三十にぞ成せましましける。
# reading_translation = His handwriting was beautiful and refined, and his learning and talents were superior, so he should have ascended to the throne, but because of the jealousy of the late Kenshunmon'in, he was confined, and in spring outings beneath the flowers he wielded a purple brush and wrote poems in his own hand, and at autumn banquets before the moon he played the jeweled flute and personally performed elegant music. Thus he passed his days and nights, and in the fourth year of Jishō, he reached the age of thirty.
# literal_translation = Imperial-handwriting beautiful and refined, Imperial-learning-and-talents superior because-was, to-the-throne should-ascend, but late-Kenshunmon'in's jealousy because-of, was-confined, beneath-the-flowers' spring outings, purple-brush wielding, by-hand own-compositions wrote, before-the-moon's autumn banquets, jeweled-flute playing, personally elegant-music performed, thus passing days and nights, in-Jishō-fourth-year, age thirty reached.
# transliteration = Onteseki utsukushū asobashi, onsaigaku sugurete mashimashikereba, kurai ni mo sokuse tamau beki ni, kokenshunmon'in no onnetami nite, oshikomerare sase tamatsuゝ, hana no shita no haru no asobi ni ha, shigō o furutte tekara onsaku o kaki, tsuki no mae no aki no en ni ha, gyokuteki o fuite mizukara gaon o ayatsuritamau, kakushite akashi kurashi tamau hodo ni, jishōyonen ni ha, ontoshi sanjū ni zo nase mashimashikeru.
