# sent_id = sent4.7.1.2
# text = 「近日世上の體を案ずるに、佛法の衰微、王法の牢籠正に此時に當れり。今度清盛入道が暴惡を戒めずば、何の日をか期すべき。宮此に入御の御事、正八幡宮の衞護、新羅大明神の冥助に非ずや。天衆地類も影向を垂れ、佛力神力も降伏を加へ坐す事などか無るべき。抑北嶺は圓宗一味の學地、南都は夏臘得度の戒場也。
# reading_translation = "When I consider the state of the world in recent times, the decline of the Buddhist Law and the weakening of the Imperial Law are exactly at this moment. If we do not now admonish the atrocities of the Novice Kiyomori, what day should we wait for? The Prince's entry into this temple—is it not the protection of the Great Hachiman Shrine and the divine aid of the Shinra Myōjin? How could it be that the heavenly beings and earthly spirits do not manifest themselves, and that the power of the Buddhas and gods does not bring about his subjugation? Now, the Northern Peak is the place of learning of the one-flavor of the Perfect Teaching, and the Southern Capital is the ordination platform for receiving the precepts after the summer retreat."
# literal_translation = Recent-times world's state when consider, Buddhist-Law's decline, Imperial-Law's weakening exactly this-time at have-arrived. This-time Novice-Kiyomori's atrocities if not admonish, what day (ACC) should wait? Prince here entering (HON) matter, Great-Hachiman-Shrine's protection, Shinra-Myōjin's divine-aid not be? Heavenly-beings earthly-spirits also manifestation (ACC) hang, Buddha-power god-power also subjugation (ACC) add (HON) matter how could not-be? Now Northern-Peak is Perfect-Teaching one-flavor's learning-place, Southern-Capital is summer-retreat receiving-precepts' ordination-platform be.
# transliteration = Kinjitsu sejō no tei o anzuru ni, buppō no suibi, ōbō no rōrō masani konotoki ni atareri. kondo kiyomorinyūdō ga bōaku o imashime zu ba, nani no hi o ka kisu beki. miya kono ni nyūgo no onkoto, shōhachimangū no eigo, shinradaimyōjin no myōjo ni hi zu ya. tenshu chirui mo yōgō o tare, butsuriki shinriki mo gōbuku o kuwae imasu koto nado ka nakaru beki. somosomo hokurei ha enshū ichimi no gakuchi, nanto ha gerō tokudo no kaijō nari.
