# sent_id = sent4.8.3.4
# text = ここに入道前太政大臣平朝臣清盛公、法名淨海、恣に國威を竊にし、朝政を亂り、内につけ外につけ、恨をなし歎をなす間、今月十五日の夜、一院第二の王子、不慮の難を遁れんがために、俄に入寺せしめ給ふ。
# reading_translation = Here, the former Grand Minister of State, Taira no Ason Kiyomori, whose Buddhist name was Jōkai, arbitrarily usurped the authority of the state, disturbed the government, and both at home and abroad caused resentment and lamentation. On the night of the fifteenth of this month, the second prince of the First Retired Emperor, in order to escape an unexpected calamity, suddenly had himself enter the temple.
