# reading_translation = At that time, although we said that we should go to meet the rebel forces and interrogate their crimes, some were wary of the divine will, and some relied on what was called an imperial edict, so while we suppressed our frustration and passed the time, they again raised troops and surrounded the second prince of the Retired Emperor's palace, whereupon the three shrines of Hachiman and Kasuga Daimyojin secretly manifested their divine presence, and reverently bearing the imperial palanquin, sent it to your noble temple and entrusted it to the gate of Shiragi.
# literal_translation = That time we should to rebel-forces go-meet, their crimes interrogate should said though, some divine-will wary, some imperial-edict called relying-on, frustration suppress time pass while, again troops raise, Retired-Emperor second prince palace surround place, Hachiman three-shrines, Kasuga Daimyojin, secretly divine-presence manifest, imperial-palanquin reverently-bear, noble-temple to send, Shiragi's gate to entrust.
