# sent_id = sent4.9.1.8
# text = 其時岩坂、櫻本にひかけ／＼、暫支へて戰ん間に、大手は、伊豆守を大將軍にて、惡僧共、六波羅に押寄せ、風上に火かけ一揉もうで攻んに、などか太政入道燒出て討ざるべき。
# reading_translation = At that time, while Iwasaka and Sakuramoto were holding out for a while, fighting, the main force, with Izu no Kami as commander, would press upon Rokuhara with the wicked monks, set fire to the windward side, and attack in one fell swoop; how could the Nyūdō Prime Minister fail to be burned out and killed?
# literal_translation = That time, Iwasaka, Sakuramoto, holding-out, while fighting, main-force, Izu-no-Kami as-commander, wicked-monks, Rokuhara, pressing, windward, fire-setting, one-rub, attacking, how, Prime-Minister, burned-out, not-kill?
