# sent_id = sent4.9.3.3
# text = 我寺の本願天武天皇は未だ春宮の御時、大友王子にはゞからせ給ひて、芳野の奧をいでさせ給ひ、大和國宇多郡を過させ給ひけるには、其勢僅に十七騎、去共伊賀伊勢に打越え、美濃尾張の勢を以て、大友王子を亡して、終に位に即せ給ひき。
# reading_translation = The founder of our temple, Emperor Tenmu, when he was still Crown Prince, was opposed by Prince Ōtomo, and so he left the depths of Yoshino and passed through Uda District in Yamato Province. At that time his force was only seventeen horsemen, but he crossed over into Iga and Ise, and with the forces of Mino and Owari he destroyed Prince Ōtomo, and finally ascended the throne.
# literal_translation = Our temple's founder Emperor Tenmu, when still Crown Prince's time, Prince Ōtomo by was-opposed, Yoshino's depths left, Yamato Province Uda District passed-through. At that time, his force only seventeen horsemen, but Iga Ise crossed-over, Mino Owari's forces with, Prince Ōtomo destroyed, finally throne ascended.
# transliteration = Wagatera no hongan tenmutennō wa imada tōgū no ontoki, ōtomonōuji ni habakara se tamai te, yoshino no oku o ide sase tamai, yamatokoku udagun o sugi sase tamai keru ni wa, sono sei wazukani jūshichiki, saredomo iga ise ni uchikoe, mino owari no sei o motte, ōtomonōuji o horoboshi te, tsuini kurai ni sokuse tamai ki.
# generator = deepseek-v4-pro
