# text = 秩父、足利、中違て、常は合戰を爲候しに、大手は長井渡、搦手は古我杉渡より寄せ候ひしに、爰に上野國の住人、新田入道、足利に語はれて、杉の渡より寄んとて儲たる舟共を秩父が方より皆破れて、申候しは、「唯今爰を渡さずば、長き弓箭の疵なるべし。
# reading_translation = Chichibu and Ashikaga were at odds, and while they were constantly fighting, the main force attacked from the Nagai ford and the rear force from the Kogasugi ford. At that time, a resident of Kozuke Province, Nyudo Nitta, was persuaded by Ashikaga and prepared boats to cross from the Sugi ford, but Chichibu's side destroyed all the boats. He said, "If we do not cross here now, it will be a lasting disgrace to our bows and arrows."
# literal_translation = Chichibu, Ashikaga, being-at-odds, constantly battle doing-was, main-force Nagai-ford, rear-force Kogasugi-ford from approached did-was, here Kozuke-Province's resident, Nitta Nyudo, by-Ashikaga being-persuaded, Sugi-ford from cross-intending prepared boats all Chichibu's side from destroyed, said was, "Just-now here if-not-cross, long bow-and-arrow's disgrace will-be."
