# sent_id = sent4.12.1.3
# text = 昔朝敵將門を亡し、勸賞蒙し俵藤太秀里に十代、足利太郎俊綱が子、又太郎忠綱、生年十七歳、か樣に無官無位なる者の、宮に向ひ參せて、弓を引き矢を放つ事天の恐少からず候へ共、弓も矢も冥加の程も、平家の御上にこそ候らめ。
# reading_translation = I am the tenth-generation descendant of Tawara Tōta Hidesato, who long ago destroyed the imperial enemy Masakado and received rewards, and the son of Ashikaga Tarō Toshitsuna: Matatarō Tadatsuna, seventeen years of age. Though I am a man without rank or office, I have come before the Prince and drawn my bow and shot arrows. I am deeply in awe of Heaven, but both my bow and arrows and my good fortune are surely due to the exalted virtue of the Heike.
# literal_translation = Long ago imperial enemy Masakado destroyed, rewards received Tawara Tōta Hidesato's tenth generation, Ashikaga Tarō Toshitsuna's son, Matatarō Tadatsuna, age seventeen years, such without rank without office person, Prince toward coming, bow drawing arrow shooting matter Heaven's awe not little is but, bow also arrows also divine protection's extent also, Heike's exalted virtue in surely is.
