# sent_id = sent4.12.7.2
# text = 案の如く、宮は三十騎許で落させ給けるを、光明山の鳥居の前にて、追附奉り、雨の降る樣に射參せければ、何が矢とは覺ねども、宮の左の御側腹に矢一筋立ければ、御馬より落させ給て、御頸取れさせ給ひけり。
# reading_translation = As expected, the Prince fled with about thirty horsemen, but they caught up with him before the torii of Kōmyōzan and shot arrows like falling rain; though no one knew whose arrow it was, one arrow struck the Prince's left side, and he fell from his horse and was beheaded.
# literal_translation = As expected, Prince with about thirty horsemen fled, but before the torii of Kōmyōzan they caught up with him, and shot arrows like falling rain; though whose arrow it was they did not know, one arrow struck the Prince's left side, and he fell from his horse and was beheaded.
