# reading_translation = In the meantime, the Lay Monk Chancellor gradually relented toward the Retired Emperor, had him released from Toba Palace, and brought him back to the capital. But because of Prince Takakura's rebellion, he became greatly enraged again, had the Retired Emperor taken to Fukuhara, boarded up all four sides, built a three-bay plank hut inside with only one opening, and confined him there. As for the guard warriors, only Harada no Tayū Tanenao was in attendance.
