# sent_id = sent5.4.1.1
# text = 同九月二日、相摸國の住人、大庭三郎景親、福原へ早馬を以て申けるは、「去ぬる八月十七日、伊豆國の流人、前右兵衞佐頼朝、舅北條四郎時政を遣して、伊豆の目代、和泉判官兼高を、やまきの館にて夜討に討候ぬ。
# reading_translation = On the second day of the ninth month, Ōba Saburō Kagechika, a resident of Sagami Province, sent a fast messenger to Fukuhara, saying: "On the seventeenth day of the eighth month past, the exile of Izu Province, the former Assistant Captain of the Right Division of Outer Palace Guards, Yoritomo, dispatched his father-in-law Hōjō Shirō Tokimasa, and in a night attack at the Yamaki mansion they slew the deputy governor of Izu, Izumi no Hangan Kanetaka."
# literal_translation = Same ninth-month second-day, Sagami-Province's resident, Ōba-Saburō-Kagechika, to-Fukuhara fast-horse by means of reported: "Past eighth-month seventeenth-day, Izu-Province's exile, former Right-Guards-Assistant-Captain Yoritomo, father-in-law Hōjō-Shirō-Tokimasa sent, Izu's deputy-governor, Izumi-no-Hangan-Kanetaka, Yamaki's mansion at night-attack in slew."
# transliteration = Dō kugatsu futsuka, sagaminokuni no jūnin, ōbasaburōkagechika, fukuhara e hayauma o motte mōshikeru wa" inuru hachigatsu jūshichinichi, izunokuni no runin, sakinōhyōenosuke yoritomo, shūto hōjōshirōtokimasa o tsukawashite, izu no mokudai, izuminohangankanetaka o, yamaki no yakata nite yōchi ni uchisōrōnu.
