# sent_id = sent5.4.1.2
# text = 其後土肥、土屋、岡崎を始として三百餘騎、石橋山に楯籠りて候處に、景親、御方に志を存ずる者共一千餘騎を引率して、押寄せ責候程に、兵衞佐七八騎に打成れ、大童に戰ひなて、土肥の杉山へ逃籠候ぬ。
# reading_translation = After that, beginning with Doi, Tsuchiya, and Okazaki, over three hundred horsemen barricaded themselves in Ishibashiyama. When Kagechika led over a thousand horsemen who were loyal to our side and attacked them, the Assistant Captain was beaten down to seven or eight horsemen, fought with his topknot undone, and fled into the Sugiyama of Doi.
# literal_translation = After-that, Doi, Tsuchiya, Okazaki as-beginning, three-hundred-remaining horsemen, Ishibashiyama at barricaded-were place, Kagechika, our-side to loyalty held people over-a-thousand-horsemen led, pressed-attacked time, Assistant-Captain seven-eight-horsemen into beaten, topknot-undone fought, Doi's Sugiyama into fled.
# transliteration = Sononochi doi, tsuchiya, okazaki o hajimetoshite sanbyakuyoki, ishibashiyama ni tatekomorite sōrōtokoro ni, kagechika, mikata ni kokorozashi o zonzuru monodomo issen'yoki o insotsushite, oshiyosesemesōrōhodo ni, hyōenosuke shichihachiki ni uchinare, ōwarawa ni tatakainate, doi no sugiyama e nigekomorisōrōnu.
