# sent_id = sent5.5.1.3
# text = 其より以降野心を狹んで、朝威を滅んとする輩、大石の山丸、大山王子、守屋の大臣、山田の石河、蘇我の入鹿、大友の眞鳥、文屋の宮田、橘の逸勢、氷上の川繼、伊豫の親王、太宰少貳藤原の廣嗣、惠美の押勝、早良の太子、井上の皇后、藤原仲成、平將門、藤原純友、安倍貞任、對馬守源義親、惡佐府、惡衞門督に至る迄、すべて廿餘人。
# reading_translation = From that time onward, those who harbored ambition and sought to overthrow the imperial authority—Ōishi no Yamamaru, Ōyama no Ōji, Moriya no Ōomi, Yamada no Ishikawa, Soga no Iruka, Ōtomo no Matori, Funya no Miyata, Tachibana no Hayanari, Hikawa no Kawatsugu, Iyo no Shinnō, Dazai no Shōni Fujiwara no Hirotsugu, Emi no Oshikatsu, Sawara no Taishi, Inoue no Kōgō, Fujiwara no Nakanari, Taira no Masakado, Fujiwara no Sumitomo, Abe no Sadatō, Tsushima no Kami Minamoto no Yoshichika, Akusafu, and Akue-mon no Kami—numbered in all more than twenty.
# literal_translation = That from onward ambition narrowing, imperial-authority overthrowing-try-to persons, Ōishi no Yamamaru, Ōyama no Ōji, Moriya no Ōomi, Yamada no Ishikawa, Soga no Iruka, Ōtomo no Matori, Funya no Miyata, Tachibana no Hayanari, Hikawa no Kawatsugu, Iyo no Shinnō, Dazai no Shōni Fujiwara no Hirotsugu, Emi no Oshikatsu, Sawara no Taishi, Inoue no Kōgō, Fujiwara no Nakanari, Taira no Masakado, Fujiwara no Sumitomo, Abe no Sadatō, Tsushima no Kami Minamoto no Yoshichika, Akusafu, Akue-mon no Kami to reaching until, all twenty-odd persons.
