# text = 同十二月二十三日、近江源氏の背きしを攻んとて、大將軍には左兵衞督知盛、薩摩守忠度、都合其勢二萬餘騎で、近江國へ發向して、山本、柏木、錦古里など云ふ溢れ源氏共一々に皆攻落し、やがて美濃尾張へ越え給ふ。
# reading_translation = On the twenty-third day of the twelfth month of the same year, to attack the Omi Genji who had rebelled, the great general was Tomomori, the Left Palace Guard Commander, and Tadanori, the Governor of Satsuma, with a total force of over twenty thousand cavalry, they departed for Omi Province, and attacked and defeated the so-called overflow Genji at Yamamoto, Kashiwagi, Nishikikori, and other places one by one, and then crossed over into Mino and Owari.
