# sent_id = sent6.5.1.1
# text = 入道相國、か樣に痛う情なう振舞おかれし事を、さすが怖とや思はれけん、法皇慰め參せんとて、安藝の嚴島の内侍が腹の御娘、生年十八に成給ふが、優に花やかにおはしけるを法皇へ參らせらる。
# reading_translation = The Lay Monk Chancellor, having behaved so cruelly and heartlessly, must have felt some fear after all, and so, to console the Retired Emperor, he presented to him his daughter by the lady of Itsukushima in Aki, a girl of eighteen, who was graceful and beautiful.
# literal_translation = Lay-Monk-Chancellor, in-this-way painfully heartlessly having-behaved, after-all fear as thought, Retired-Emperor to-console thinking, Aki's Itsukushima's lady's womb's daughter, age eighteen became, graceful and beautiful was, to-Retired-Emperor presented.
