# sent_id = sent6.6.5.1
# text = 同十六日に、伊豫國より飛脚到來、去年の冬比より、河野四郎通清を初として、四國の者共皆平家を背いて、源氏に同心の間、備後國の住人、額の入道西寂、平家に志深かりければ、伊豫國へ押渡り、道前道後のさかひ、高直城にて、河野四郎通清を討候ぬ。
# reading_translation = On the sixteenth of the same month, a courier arrived from Iyo Province. Since last winter, beginning with Kōno Shirō Michikiyo, all the warriors of Shikoku had turned against the Heike and sided with the Genji. Because the priest Nukada no Nyūdō Saijaku, a resident of Bingo Province, was deeply loyal to the Heike, he crossed over to Iyo Province and killed Kōno Shirō Michikiyo at Takanao Castle on the border between Dōzen and Dōgo.
# literal_translation = Same sixteenth day on, from Iyo Province courier arrived, last year's winter time from, Kōno Shirō Michikiyo as beginning, Shikoku's warriors all Heike against, Genji with same heart because, Bingo Province's resident, Nukada no Nyūdō Saijaku, Heike to loyalty deep was because, Iyo Province to crossed over, Dōzen Dōgo's border, Takanao Castle at, Kōno Shirō Michikiyo killed.
