# text = 額入道西寂河野四郎通清を討て後、四國の狼藉を鎭め、今年正月十五日に備後の鞆へ押渡り、遊君遊女共聚めて、遊戲れ酒もりしけるが、前後も知らず醉臥したる處に、河野四郎思切たる者共百餘人相語て、はと押寄す。
# reading_translation = After Nukui no Nyūdō Saijaku killed Kōno Shirō Michikiyo, he subdued the outrages in Shikoku, and on the fifteenth day of the first month of this year, he crossed over to Tomo in Bingo, gathered together courtesans and prostitutes, and was enjoying himself drinking sake, when, without knowing what was before or behind, he fell asleep drunk; then Kōno Shirō, with more than a hundred determined men, conspired together and suddenly attacked.
