# text = 或時殿上人一兩人、北面少々召具して、しのびの御幸有しに、比は五月廿日餘のまだ宵の事なれば、目さすとも知ぬ闇ではあり、五月雨さへ掻暮し、誠にいぶせかりけるに、件の女房の宿所近く御堂あり。
# reading_translation = Once, when the Emperor made a secret excursion accompanied by one or two courtiers and a few of the Northern Guards, it was the twentieth day of the Fifth Month and still early evening, so it was a darkness in which one could not see one's hand before one's face; moreover, the long rains of the Fifth Month had made it overcast, and it was truly gloomy, when near the lodging of that lady-in-waiting there was a chapel.
