# sent_id = sent7.3.1.10
# text = 彼秦皇、漢武、或は童男丱女を遣はし、或は方士をして不死の藥を尋ね給ひしに、蓬莱を見ずばいなや歸らじと云て、徒に船の中にて老い、天水茫々として求る事を得ざりけん蓬莱洞の有樣もかくや在けんとぞ見えし。
# reading_translation = That Qin Shi Huang and Han Wu, sometimes sending young boys and girls, sometimes ordering alchemists to seek the elixir of immortality, said that if they did not see Penglai they would not return, and so they aged in vain aboard their ships; the vast blue sea stretched endlessly and they could not obtain what they sought—the appearance of the Penglai grotto must have been just like this.
# literal_translation = That Qin Shi Huang, Han Wu, sometimes young boys and girls sent, sometimes alchemists made to seek the medicine of immortality, if Penglai they did not see, they would not return, saying, in vain in the boat they aged, the sky and water vast and boundless, the thing they sought they could not obtain—the appearance of the Penglai grotto, was it like this, it seemed.
