# sent_id = sent7.5.1.9
# text = 其時義仲暫會釋ふ樣に持なして、日を待昏し、平家の大勢を倶利迦羅谷へ追落さうと思ふなり。」とて先白旗三十旒、先立てゝ黒坂の上にぞ打立たる。案の如く平家是を見て、「あはや源氏の先陣は向たるは、定めて大勢成らん。左右無う廣みへ打出なば、敵は案内者、我等は無案内也。
# reading_translation = At that time Yoshinaka, pretending to be at ease for a while, waited for the sun to set, intending to drive the great force of the Heike into the Kurikara valley. So saying, he first raised thirty white banners and set them up on Kurozaka. As expected, the Heike saw this and said, "Ah, the vanguard of the Genji is facing us; surely they must be a great force. If we go out into the open without hesitation, the enemy knows the terrain, while we do not."
# literal_translation = That time Yoshinaka for-a-while at-ease manner making, sun waited-for-darkness, Heike's great-force Kurikara-valley-into drive-down-intend think. So-saying first white-banner thirty-flags, first-raise Kurozaka's top-on indeed set-up. As-expected Heike this saw, "Ah Genji's vanguard facing is, surely great-force be-will. Without-hesitation open-area-into go-out-if, enemy is-guide-person, we are-no-guide."
# transliteration = Sono toki yoshinaka shibaraku eshau sama ni mochinashite, hi o machikurashi, heike no ōzei o kurikaradani he oiotosō to omō nari。」 tote mazu shirahata sanjūryū, sakidatete kurosaka no ue ni zo uchitatetaru. an no gotoku heike kore o mite," awaya genji no senjin ha mukitaru ha, sadamete ōzei naran. sōnaku hiromi he uchīdenaba, teki ha annaisha, warera ha muannai nari.
