# reading_translation = The matter of wearing a brocade hitatare: when Saitō Bettō took his final leave, he went to the Minister and said, "It is not a matter of my own person alone, but when I went to the East the year before last, startled by the sound of waterfowl wings, I fled from Kambara in Suruga Province without shooting even a single arrow. That is the shame of my old age, and only this matter."
